# The prepare spell is a sorcery (CR 722, 304.1): the copy in exile cannot be cast during Bot2's turn 2 (the refusal; the
# cast on Bot1's own turn 3 with an empty stack is the positive control). "You may discard a card. If you do, draw a
# card": Bot1 chooses no card, so nothing is discarded and nothing drawn - the hand is the one it had. The copy is still
# cast (unprepared), and the Battlemage is still a creature, 2/2 with prowess until end of turn.

